    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d320-a4">

                <pb facs="0877" n="663" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg663"/>


                <head>Mr. Mariscal to Mr.
                        Nelson</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Private.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 23, 1871.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Nelson</hi>: I received your letter of
                    the 21st instant, with the accompanying newspapers from Texas, relative to
                    cattle stealing on the border. The attention of the President has been called to
                    that subject, and some measures will be adopted tending to remedy that
                    situation.</p>
                <p>Very truly yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>IGNACIO MARISCAL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
